      <h1 class="section-heading mb-6 leading-[1.08] tracking-tight">Building practical software, backend systems, and data products.</h1>

      <p class="text-lg lg:text-xl text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-3xl">Computer engineering student working with Java, Python, SQL, APIs, and machine learning. I build backend services, reproducible data workflows, and applications for concrete problems.</p>
      <p class="text-base text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl">Background in work and organizational psychology, applied selectively to organizational data and HR technology.</p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-12">
